# 2026-09-30 (Claude): Created. The server had no .gitignore, so .env (Resend API key, JWT secrets),
#   node_modules and dist were committed and GitHub push protection blocked the push.
# 2026-10-05 (Claude): Ignored data/ (Kaggle Amazon CSVs, ~350MB) used by the seed script.

node_modules
dist
.env
*.log
.DS_Store
data/
